{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07278","headline":"栖霞寺东峰寻南齐明徵君故居 · 刘长卿","name":"栖霞寺东峰寻南齐明徵君故居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山人今不见，山鸟自相从。\n长啸辞明主，终身卧此峰。\n泉源通石径，磵户掩尘容。\n古墓依寒草，前朝寄老松。\n片云生断壁，万壑遍疎钟。\n惆怅空归去，犹疑林下逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}